<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Mar 11.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Mar 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Mar 112.00 Apr 113.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Avon range Mar 98.00 Apr/Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Apr 100.00</p>
<p>Essex/Suffolk Apr/Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 98.00/98.50 Apr/Jun 102.00/01.50/01.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Apr/Jun 100.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire Apr/Jun 100.00 Jul 102.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr/Jun 102.50 Jul 105.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 96.50/96.25 Apr/Jun 98.50/98.00</p>
<p>Avon range Apr/Jun 98.00</p>
</text>
